    "formula_steps": [
      "Require the exact immutable 240-position continuous-session grid for each stock-day already present in the joint-clean base.",
      "Read only CNY amount and require all 240 values to be finite and nonnegative with a finite strictly positive sum.",
      "Normalize each valid stock-day to p_i,t=amount_i,t/sum_t(amount_i,t).",
      "For every trade date and position, sum p_j,t and count valid complete stock-day profiles across the same immutable source pool.",
      "For stock i subtract p_i,t and one from those same-date aggregates, then divide to obtain the equal-weight leave-one-out market profile m_-i,t.",
      "Require at least 50 leave-one-out peers at every one of the 240 positions.",
      "Compute ordinary intercept-adjusted Pearson correlation between p_i and m_-i across the 240 aligned positions.",
      "A constant own profile or constant leave-one-out market profile is missing. Otherwise only 1e-12 floating-point endpoint canonicalization to [-1,1] is allowed.",
      "Do not include 09:30, read prices or returns, change similarity, invert direction, alter peers or weights, transform, threshold, filter, subset, rewindow, clip, impute, winsorize, rank, or substitute a daily value."
    ],
    "formula": "corr(amount_i/sum(amount_i), leave_one_out_equal_weight_mean_j(amount_j/sum(amount_j))) across exact aligned 09:31-15:00 positions",
    "validity": {
      "all_240_amount_values_finite_and_nonnegative": true,
      "strictly_positive_continuous_session_amount": true,
      "minimum_leave_one_out_peers_at_every_position": 50,
      "constant_own_profile_policy": "missing",
      "constant_leave_one_out_market_profile_policy": "missing",
      "allowed_closed_interval": [
        -1,
        1
      ],
      "endpoint_canonicalization_tolerance": 1e-12,
      "merge_transform_clip_impute_winsorize_rank_threshold_filter_or_daily_substitution_allowed": false
    },
    "hypothesis": "A high value means the stock's intraday liquidity participation follows broad-market liquidity waves rather than isolated bursts, indicating more orderly and broadly sponsored trading that may persist from the next open through the third close.",
    "economic_distinction": "The factor cannot be computed from a single stock-day: changing other stocks' normalized amount profiles changes its leave-one-out benchmark and value while the stock's own profile remains fixed. It reads no price, return, 09:30 amount, volume, daily market state, index price, industry label, market capitalization, or forward return.",
    "rejected_before_value_observation": [
